```mermaid
graph TD

    subgraph NetworkMeasurementService

        NMS["Inicio da Medicao"]

        MTU_LOOP{"Testar tamanhos\n1500 1400 1300 ate 576"}

        UDP_SEND["DatagramSocket UDP\nEnviar pacote sem fragmentar"]

        MTU_FOUND["Retorna MTU real\n1500 bytes"]

        RTT_LOOP{"Loop 10 amostras"}

        TCP_CONN["Socket connect TCP\nHost 8.8.8.8 porta 53"]

        RTT_CALC["Armazena RTT\nIda e volta"]

        STATS["Calcula media minimo\nmaximo e jitter"]

        NMS -->|Descobrir MTU| MTU_LOOP

        MTU_LOOP -->|Enviar UDP| UDP_SEND

        UDP_SEND -->|Sucesso| MTU_FOUND

        UDP_SEND -->|Falha ou timeout| MTU_LOOP

        NMS -->|Medir latencia TCP| RTT_LOOP

        RTT_LOOP -->|Socket connect| TCP_CONN

        TCP_CONN -->|nanoTime| RTT_CALC

        RTT_CALC -->|Fim do loop| STATS

    end

    TLS["TlsOverheadService"]

    MTU_FOUND -.->|Injeta MTU| TLS

    STATS -.->|Injeta RTT medio| TLS

    classDef network fill:#e2e3e5,stroke:#343a40,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef udp fill:#d1ecf1,stroke:#17a2b8;
    classDef tcp fill:#cce5ff,stroke:#007bff;

    class NMS network;

    class MTU_LOOP,UDP_SEND,MTU_FOUND udp;

    class RTT_LOOP,TCP_CONN,RTT_CALC,STATS tcp;
```